('alict_00001', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'What technology was used in ENIAC and EDV AC computers?', '["Vacuum tube", "Integrated circuits", "transistors", "microprocessors", "resistors"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Correct answer: "Vacuum tube". This reflects how this hardware component/device is defined and used in a standard computer system.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 2027, 1, '2027 Quiz Series'),
