('alict_00006', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'A company is developing prosthetic limbs for patients using a special technology. This technology and rapid production of limb parts based on the patient''s measurements. It also helps reduce material waste and costs. iud.ula frda.Ska md ixj¾Okh u.ska frda.shdf.a md fldgia bv wvq o th could this special technology be', '["A barcode scanner", "A large 3D printer", "A projector", "A joystick", "A keyboard"]'::jsonb, 2, 'This question describes a technology that creates customized parts based on individual is allows rapid production and reduces material waste and cost. m%Yakh bv These are all key features of 3D especially in medical applications like prosthetics', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 2027, 6, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00007', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'If teacher wants to check MCQ answers of papers. What is the device can be used to fulfill that need?', '["MICR", "NFC Reader", "OCR", "Digitizer", "OMR"]'::jsonb, 5, 'The suitable device can be used to fulfill that need is OMR. tu Device Purpose MICR Used to check validity of a cheques which are printed using special magnetic ink. NFC Reader device that can wirelessly communicate with NFC-enabled devices or tags within close proximity', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 2027, 7, '2027 Quiz Series'),
