('alict_00013', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'Which answer correctly describes the characteristics of laser and LED two types of optical mouse?', '["The movements of the LED mouse are more precise than the laser mouse", "Laser mouse works on any surface while LED mouse does not", "Laser mouse is cheaper than led mouse. LED", "Only the technology used by the two types of mouse differs and there is no difference in accuracy", "All of the above are false"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "Laser mouse works on any surface while LED mouse does not". This reflects how this hardware component/device is defined and used in a standard computer system.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 2027, 13, '2027 Quiz Series'),
