('alict_00314', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following correctly describes the sequence of steps that a computer follows to execute an instruction?', '["Fetch \u2192 Decode \u2192 Execute \u2192 Store f.k \u2192", "Decode \u2192 Fetch \u2192 Execute \u2192 Store", "Store \u2192 Fetch \u2192 Execute \u2192 Decode \u2192 f.k \u2192", "Fetch \u2192 Execute \u2192 Store \u2192 Decode f.k \u2192", "Execute \u2192 Decode \u2192 Fetch \u2192 Store"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Fetch The CPU retrieves an instruction from memory. This step involves reading the instruction code from a specific memory usually pointed to by the program counter ljqkagrh 2) Decode The fetched instruction is decoded to understand what actions are required', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 314, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00315', 12, 'General ICT', 'What was the first digital computer to use stored programs created by man?', '["EDV AC", "IBM 701", "MARK 1", "Manchester Baby", "Abacus"]'::jsonb, 4, 'Correct answer: "Manchester Baby".', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 315, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00316', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following memory types belong to the volatile memory type?', '["A only. A", "A and C only. A C", "D only. D", "B and D only. B D", "All of the above"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "A and C only. A C".', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 316, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00317', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following statement is true regarding software types and usage?', '["An interpreter translates code into machine language all at similar to a compiler", "Open-source software cannot be used and modified without restrictions", "Proprietary software requires a license for and using it without a license is legal in some cases", "Utility software includes programs that help manage computer such as antivirus and disk management tools", "None of above"]'::jsonb, 4, '• Option 1: This statement is false. An interpreter translates code into machine language line -by-line or instruction- executing each line immediately. In a compiler translates the entire code at once into machine language before producing an executable file', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 317, '2027 Quiz Series'),
