('alict_00351', 12, 'General ICT', 'What is a characteristic of a cathode ray tube (CRT) display?', '["Thin and lightweight design", "Low power consumption", "Limited viewing angles", "High refresh rates", "Energy-efficient operation"]'::jsonb, 3, 'A characteristic of a cathode ray tube (CRT) display is 3) Limited viewing angles. CRT displays typically have limited viewing angles compared to modern display technologies like LCD or OLED. The image quality and color accuracy can degrade significantly when viewed from an angle', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 351, '2027 Quiz Series'),
