('alict_00398', 12, 'General ICT', 'What is the primary purpose of an SR latch circuit?', '["To amplify electrical", "To store a single bit of", "To perform arithmetic wxl", "To filter noise in a y\u00f7kd", "To regulate voltage"]'::jsonb, 2, 'An SR part of a is a fundamental building block in digital electronics used for storing one bit of data. It can hold either a 0 or a 1 until it is set or reset', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 398, '2027 Quiz Series'),
