('alict_00401', 12, 'General ICT', 'What is the output of the following logic expression represented by AND OR gates?', '["Output is 1 if A or B is 1 and C is 0, otherwise 0 A B = 1 C = 0", "Output is 1 if C is 0, otherwise 0 C = 0", "Output is 1 only if A and B are both 1 and C is 0", "Output is Always 1, regardless of inputs", "Output is Always 0, regardless of inputs"]'::jsonb, 1, '(A OR B): For this statement to be it is sufficient that only one of the inputs A or B is true. But both can be true as well. (A OR B): (NOT C): For this statement to be C must be false', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 401, '2027 Quiz Series'),
