('alict_00433', 12, 'General ICT', 'A = 458 B = 3510 C = 2016 D = 000111002 Which of the following answer represents the ascending order of the above numbers?', '["DBCA", "DCBA", "CDBA", "ABDC", "ABCD"]'::jsonb, 2, 'To get the ascending order of the above numbers first we have to convert all of them into one number type. Let''s convert all the numbers to decimals because it is easier to determine their ascending order in decimal form. D the answer is 2)', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 433, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00434', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following types of software users typically work with applications designed for personal tasks and productivity?', '["Single-user", "Multi-user", "Site user", "Super-user", "Administrator"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Option 1: Single-user software is designed for use by one person at a time. These applications are typically used for personal tasks and such as word personal finance and other personal productivity tools', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 434, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00435', 12, 'General ICT', 'Plagiarism can best be defined', '["Copying someone else''s work and citing the source", "Using open-source content for commercial use", "Submitting another person''s work as your own", "Creating original content based on multiple sources. nyq", "Using software without a license"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Plagiarism refers to presenting someone else''s or words as your own without proper credit. It is a serious ethical violation in and creative fields. Explanation of each option 1: Incorrect because copying and citing is not plagiarism', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 435, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00436', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following is not a service provided by G2C?', '["Map of Sri Lanka", "Law system", "Election results", "Sri Lankan custom details", "Vehicle registration"]'::jsonb, 4, 'Option 1: This could be a part of G2C services as it helps citizens with geographical and locational information. Option 2: This is likely to be a service provided by the government to inform citizens(G2C) about the legal framework and systems', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 436, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00437', 12, 'General ICT', 'What is a distinguishing feature of short throw projectors?', '["They can project large images from a short distance", "They require a large room to operate effectively", "They have higher resolution than other projectors", "They are less expensive than long throw projectors. long throw", "They use laser technology exclusively"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The correct answer 3) 16 bits A hexadecimal number is base 16, meaning each digit in a hexadecimal number can be represented by 4 bits. to determine the minimum number of bits needed to represent a hexadecimal you can multiply the number of hexadecimal digits by 4', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 437, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00438', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following statements about printers is FALSE?', '["Laser printers use toner to print documents", "Inkjet printers use liquid ink to print documents", "Dot matrix printers are known for high-quality photo printing", "Thermal printers use heat to transfer ink onto paper. lvodis", "D printers create three-dimensional objects from digital models"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Dot matrix printers are not known for high-quality photo printing. They are an older technology that prints by striking a ribbon of ink against the which results in lower resolution prints compared to modern printers like inkjet or laser printers', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 438, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00439', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following methods is most effective in helping to avoid plagiarism?', '["Copying from multiple sources", "Using synonyms to change a few words from the source", "Using proper citations and quotation marks", "Copying and pasting from websites", "Submitting someone else''s work"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Plagiarism is the act of presenting someone else''s or words as your own without proper acknowledgment. Among the most effective way to avoid plagiarism is by citing the sources properly and using quotation marks when including someone else''s exact words', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 439, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00440', 12, 'General ICT', 'AA + D(0̅1̅̅̅̅ + DA̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅) What is the simplified answer of this?', '["1", "AD", "0", "A", "D"]'::jsonb, 1, 'AA + D(0̅1̅̅̅̅ + DA̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅) AA + D̅ + (0̅1̅̅̅̅ + DA̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅̅) De Morgan''s law AA + D̅ + 0̅1̿̿̿̿(D̅ + A̅) De Morgan''s law AA + D̅ + 0̅1(D̅ + A̅) Double complement law AA + D̅ + 11(D̅ + A̅) (0̅ = 1) AA + D̅ + (D̅ + A̅) Identity law A + D̅ + (D̅ + A̅) Idempotent law 1 Identi', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 440, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00441', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following statements about computer displays is FALSE?', '["LCD displays use liquid crystals to produce images. LCD", "OLED displays offer deeper blacks and higher contrast than OLED", "CRT monitors are known for their slim design and energy efficiency. CRT fudksgr isyska", "Touchscreen displays allow user interaction directly on the screen", "LED displays use light-emitting diodes for backlighting. LED"]'::jsonb, 3, 'CRT (Cathode Ray Tube) monitors are and heavy due to the vacuum tube technology they use. They are also significantly less energy-efficient than modern display technologies like and OLED', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 441, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00442', 12, 'General ICT', 'D116 + 1778 = ............ What is the value that suits the blank here?', '["110010", "45510", "F16", "45016", "0101010101002"]'::jsonb, 4, 'the octal number 1778 must be converted into a hexadecimal number. To do first convert it to a binary number and then convert it to a hexadecimal number. Then add the two hexadecimal numbers 3D116 and 7F16 together to get the answer', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 442, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00443', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of these is not a licensed software?', '["MS Windows", "Apple IOS", "Zoom", "Adobe Creative Suite", "Linux"]'::jsonb, 5, 'Software can be divided into several parts as follows. Proprietary software These softwares have to be purchased and then repaid after a period of time to continue using them. For MS Apple Adobe Creative Suite can be taken', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 443, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00444', 12, 'General ICT', 'What was the first developed full size stored program computer?', '["ENIAC", "EDSAC", "EDV AC", "UNIV AC", "MARK 1"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Let''s go through the options provided as answers. • ENIAC (Electronic Numerical Integrator and Computer) Developed in the it was one of the first electronic general-purpose computers but did not use the stored-program 1940', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 444, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00445', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following statements accurately describes the function of a CAT (Computerized Axial Tomography) machine in medical imaging?', '["CAT machines are primarily used for measuring blood pressure and heart rate. CAT", "CAT machines generate detailed images of internal body structures using X -rays and computer processing techniques. CAT", "CAT machines are specialized instruments for monitoring brain activity and electrical impulses. CAT", "CAT machines are used for administering medications and intravenous injections. CAT", "CAT machines produce three-dimensional models of organs using ultrasound waves. CAT"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Option 1: This statement is incorrect. CAT machines are not used for measuring blood pressure or heart rate. They are primarily used for imaging internal body structures. iamkaok Option 2: This statement is accurate', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 445, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00446', 12, 'General ICT', 'What is a potential disadvantage of bespoke software?', '["Lack of customization options", "Generic features that may not suit the user''s needs", "Higher development cost and time compared to off-the-shelf software", "Incompatibility with specific hardware", "Limited user support"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Bespoke Software This is software specifically tailored to meet the unique requirements of an organization or user. It is custom-developed from scratch or heavily modified to suit particular needs', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 446, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00447', 12, 'General ICT', 'What will be the most simplified expression of F?', '["A. B. A\u0305 + A. B. C\u0305", "A. B. A\u0305 + A. B. B\u0305 + A. B. C\u0305", "A. B. C\u0305", "A. B. B\u0305 + A. B. C\u0305", "None of the above"]'::jsonb, 3, 'the AND gate is represented by ( . ) which corresponds to multiplication ( × )', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 447, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00448', 12, 'General ICT', 'What is the simplest form of (X + Y)(X + Z)?', '["X", "X+Y.Z", "X.(Y+Z)", "X+Y+Z", "X.Y.Z"]'::jsonb, 2, 'This boolean expression can be simplfied as follows. (X + Y)(X + Z) XX + XZ + (X + Z).Y Distribution law X + XZ + (X + Z).Y Idempotent law X + (X + Z)', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 448, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00449', 12, 'General ICT', 'Charles Babbage is often referred to as the "father of the computer" due to his work on which unfinished invention that introduced many concepts of modern computing?', '["ENIAC", "Analytical Engine", "Difference Engine", "IBM 701", "UNIV AC"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The Analytical designed by Charles Babbage in the was a proposed mechanical general- purpose computer. 1830 Although never it introduced critical ideas like the control input programming using punched cards', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 449, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00450', 12, 'General ICT', 'Each block of a disk is 256 bytes. When a file of size 2025 bytes is stored on that how many bytes allocated to the file would be wasted?', '["89", "256", "279", "1792", "23"]'::jsonb, 5, 'To determine the number of wasted follow these Block Each block is 256 bytes. File The file size is 2025 bytes. 2025 Number of Blocks Since each block can store 256 we', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 450, '2027 Quiz Series')
