('alict_00459', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following statements is true?', '["Charles Babbage introduced the logarithm theory", "William Oughtred improved the adding machine and built the stepper so that it could also perform multiplication and division", "Herman Hollerith took the first American census using punch cards", "Joseph Jacquard was the world''s first programmer", "Gottfried Wilhelm Leibniz invented the adding machine"]'::jsonb, 3, '2025/08/21 Information and Communication Technology 1) PROM 2) EPROM 3) EEPROM 4) RAM 5) None of the above • Logarithm theory was introduced to the world by John Napier. • Gottfried Wilhelm Leibniz built the step calculator to improve the adding machine and perform multiplication and division', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 459, '2027 Quiz Series'),
