('alict_00461', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which of the following is an advantage of using a V oice User Interface (VUI)?', '["It requires the user to have advanced technical knowledge", "It allows hands-free making it useful in situations like driving or cooking. th", "It always provides a more accurate response than graphical interfaces. th", "It is only suitable for short commands and cannot handle complex tasks. th", "It requires more system resources than other interfaces like CLI or GUI. thg CLI GUI jeks"]'::jsonb, 2, 'VUI allows users to interact with devices without using their making it convenient and safer in situations where manual interaction is not possible or practical. VUI It allows hands-free making it useful in situations like driving or cooking. th The correct answer is 2)', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 461, '2027 Quiz Series'),
