('alict_00467', 12, 'General ICT', 'Which key advantage is generally offered by laser printers compared to inkjet printers?', '["Lower cost per printed page due to more efficient toner usage", "Superior image quality for photographs and detailed graphics", "Good for the health of humans", "Enhanced portability and suitability for smaller workspaces", "Greater versatility in handling different types of printing media"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Option 1: Laser printers use which is typically more efficient and cost-effective over time compared to the ink used in inkjet printers. Toner cartridges last longer and produce more leading to a lower cost per printed page', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'General ICT', 2027, 467, '2027 Quiz Series'),
